{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38875","headline":"春日登楼遇雨 · 杜荀鹤","name":"春日登楼遇雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽地晴天作雨天，全无暑气似秋间。\n看看水没来时路，渐渐云藏望处山。\n风趁鹭鸶双出苇，浪催渔父尽归湾。\n一心准拟闲登眺，却被诗情使不闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}